          "description": "四個技術單元以原理／架構與實驗／驗證兩步完成「資產與信任邊界」；每步獨立保存進度與知識測驗。",
          "descriptionEn": "Four technical units develop assets and trust boundaries through separate principle/architecture and experiment/validation tasks with saved progress and knowledge checks.",
