              "title": "資產身分：原理與架構",
              "titleEn": "Asset identity: principles and architecture",
              "objective": "以「資產身分」建立可檢查的架構、原理與驗證依據。",
              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for asset identity.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「資產身分」的資料、控制與時間關係。IP 可能改變，資產鍵需維持穩定。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「合併兩次假想盤點並查重。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for asset identity. IPs may change; asset keys must remain stable. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Merge two synthetic inventories and check duplicates. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "合併兩次假想盤點並查重。",
              "observationEn": "Merge two synthetic inventories and check duplicates.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：內網登入即授權所有資源。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Internal login authorizes every resource. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「資產身分」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「IP 可能改變，資產鍵需維持穩定。」。",
