                  "titleEn": "ISA and microarchitecture validation design",
                  "text": "比較同一指令序列的兩種時程。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare two schedules for one instruction sequence. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-o3",
                    "v11a-minor"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a302-v11-02-k3",
                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假設非重疊停頓模型的基礎 CPI=1，分支佔 20%、誤預測率 5%、代價 12 cycles。ΔCPI=0.20×0.05×12=0.12，總 CPI=1.12；3 GHz 執行 10⁹ 指令約 0.373 s。忽略快取及重疊隱藏。",
                  "textEn": "For a nonoverlapping-stall model, base CPI=1, branch fraction=20%, misprediction rate=5%, penalty=12 cycles. ΔCPI=0.12 and total CPI=1.12; 10⁹ instructions at 3 GHz take about 0.373 s, ignoring cache and overlap effects.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-o3",
                    "v11a-minor"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「ISA 與微架構」與整體「CPU 管線與分支預測」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing isa and microarchitecture within cpu pipelines and branch prediction, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "重新命名也會消除真正 RAW 相依。",
                  "比較同一指令序列的兩種時程。",
                  "寬解碼保證所有程式 CPI 同比下降。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Renaming also removes true RAW dependencies.",
                  "Compare two schedules for one instruction sequence.",
                  "Wider decode guarantees proportional CPI reduction."
                ],
                "answer": 1,
                "explanation": "相同指令集可用不同管線實作。 比較同一指令序列的兩種時程。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "The same ISA permits different pipelines. Compare two schedules for one instruction sequence. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
