                    "v11a-minor"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「方向預測」與整體「CPU 管線與分支預測」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing direction prediction within cpu pipelines and branch prediction, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "重新命名也會消除真正 RAW 相依。",
                  "飽和計數器保留有限分支歷史。",
                  "寬解碼保證所有程式 CPI 同比下降。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Renaming also removes true RAW dependencies.",
                  "Saturating counters retain limited branch history.",
                  "Wider decode guarantees proportional CPI reduction."
                ],
