                "explanation": "飽和計數器保留有限分支歷史。 逐次模擬 TTNT 的狀態。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Saturating counters retain limited branch history. Simulate counter states for TTNT. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
