              "instruction": "重播師傅對「歷史別名」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：改變索引位數比較衝突。 核對「不同分支可競爭同一預測表項。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for history aliasing and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Change index width and compare collisions. Check the principle: Branches can compete for one predictor entry. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "改變索引位數比較衝突。",
              "observationEn": "Change index width and compare collisions.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：重新命名也會消除真正 RAW 相依。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Renaming also removes true RAW dependencies. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「歷史別名」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「改變索引位數比較衝突。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit history aliasing input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
