                {
                  "id": "a302-v11-27-k2",
                  "title": "CPI 分解的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "CPI decomposition validation design",
                  "text": "用本課非重疊假設核算。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Audit the course nonoverlap assumption. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-o3",
                    "v11a-minor"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「CPI 分解」與整體「CPU 管線與分支預測」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing cpi decomposition within cpu pipelines and branch prediction, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "重新命名也會消除真正 RAW 相依。",
                  "寬解碼保證所有程式 CPI 同比下降。",
                  "重疊停頓不能直接重複相加。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Renaming also removes true RAW dependencies.",
                  "Wider decode guarantees proportional CPI reduction.",
                  "Overlapping stalls cannot simply be added twice."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "重疊停頓不能直接重複相加。 用本課非重疊假設核算。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Overlapping stalls cannot simply be added twice. Audit the course nonoverlap assumption. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
