              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「寫入擁有權」與整體「快取一致性多核心系統」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing write ownership within cache-coherent multicore systems, which statement or check is supported?",
