              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「目錄追蹤」的資料、控制與時間關係。目錄追蹤共享者，避免總廣播。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「比較全位元圖與有限指標。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for directory tracking. Directories track sharers to reduce broadcasts. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Compare full bitmaps and limited pointers. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "比較全位元圖與有限指標。",
              "observationEn": "Compare full bitmaps and limited pointers.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：一致性快取可取代所有同步原語。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Coherent caches replace all synchronization primitives. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「目錄追蹤」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「目錄追蹤共享者，避免總廣播。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit directory tracking two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a303-v11-13-k1",
                  "title": "目錄追蹤的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Directory tracking principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "目錄追蹤共享者，避免總廣播。",
                  "textEn": "Directories track sharers to reduce broadcasts.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-coherence",
                    "v11a-false"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a303-v11-13-k2",
                  "title": "目錄追蹤的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Directory tracking validation design",
                  "text": "比較全位元圖與有限指標。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare full bitmaps and limited pointers. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-coherence",
                    "v11a-false"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「目錄追蹤」與整體「快取一致性多核心系統」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing directory tracking within cache-coherent multicore systems, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "目錄追蹤共享者，避免總廣播。",
                  "一致性快取可取代所有同步原語。",
                  "填補變數會消除所有真共享。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Directories track sharers to reduce broadcasts.",
                  "Coherent caches replace all synchronization primitives.",
                  "Padding eliminates all true sharing."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "目錄追蹤共享者，避免總廣播。 比較全位元圖與有限指標。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Directories track sharers to reduce broadcasts. Compare full bitmaps and limited pointers. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
