              "title": "假共享：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "False sharing: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「比較同列與分列計數器。」檢查「假共享」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for false sharing using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「假共享」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：比較同列與分列計數器。 核對「獨立變數共行可產生擁有權震盪。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for false sharing and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Compare same-line and separated counters. Check the principle: Independent same-line variables can bounce ownership. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "比較同列與分列計數器。",
              "observationEn": "Compare same-line and separated counters.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：一致性快取可取代所有同步原語。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Coherent caches replace all synchronization primitives. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「假共享」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「比較同列與分列計數器。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit false sharing input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a303-v11-18-k1",
                  "title": "假共享的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "False sharing principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "獨立變數共行可產生擁有權震盪。",
                  "textEn": "Independent same-line variables can bounce ownership.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-coherence",
                    "v11a-false"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a303-v11-18-k2",
                  "title": "假共享的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "False sharing validation design",
                  "text": "比較同列與分列計數器。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare same-line and separated counters. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-coherence",
                    "v11a-false"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「假共享」與整體「快取一致性多核心系統」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing false sharing within cache-coherent multicore systems, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "一致性快取可取代所有同步原語。",
                  "填補變數會消除所有真共享。",
                  "比較同列與分列計數器。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Coherent caches replace all synchronization primitives.",
                  "Padding eliminates all true sharing.",
                  "Compare same-line and separated counters."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "獨立變數共行可產生擁有權震盪。 比較同列與分列計數器。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Independent same-line variables can bounce ownership. Compare same-line and separated counters. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
            },
