              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「真共享」的資料、控制與時間關係。填補不能消除共同資料的寫入競爭。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「區分共享鎖與分離計數器。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for true sharing. Padding cannot remove genuine shared-write contention. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Distinguish shared locks from separate counters. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
