              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for barrier convergence. Required threads must obey barrier participation. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Audit barrier paths inside branches. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
