              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for stream dependencies and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Draw copy, compute and event dependencies. Check the principle: Overlap must not overwrite unfinished data. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
