              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「數值誤差」的資料、控制與時間關係。浮點歸約順序會改變捨入。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「比較絕對與相對誤差。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for numerical error. Reduction order changes rounding. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Compare absolute and relative error. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "比較絕對與相對誤差。",
              "observationEn": "Compare absolute and relative error.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：佔用率最高的設定必定最快。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: The highest occupancy configuration is always fastest. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「數值誤差」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「浮點歸約順序會改變捨入。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit numerical error two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
