              "title": "張量維度：原理與架構",
              "titleEn": "Tensor dimensions: principles and architecture",
              "objective": "以「張量維度」建立可檢查的架構、原理與驗證依據。",
              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for tensor dimensions.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「張量維度」的資料、控制與時間關係。矩陣相乘的內維度必須相容。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「核對 M×K 與 K×N 形狀。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for tensor dimensions. Matrix inner dimensions must agree. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Check M×K and K×N shapes. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "核對 M×K 與 K×N 形狀。",
              "observationEn": "Check M×K and K×N shapes.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：BF16 與 FP16 有相同指數和尾數配置。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: BF16 and FP16 have identical exponent and mantissa layouts. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「張量維度」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「矩陣相乘的內維度必須相容。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit tensor dimensions two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a305-v11-01-k1",
                  "title": "張量維度的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Tensor dimensions principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "矩陣相乘的內維度必須相容。",
                  "textEn": "Matrix inner dimensions must agree.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-tpu",
                    "v11a-bf16"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a305-v11-01-k2",
                  "title": "張量維度的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Tensor dimensions validation design",
                  "text": "核對 M×K 與 K×N 形狀。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Check M×K and K×N shapes. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-tpu",
                    "v11a-bf16"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a305-v11-01-k3",
                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假想 128×128 MAC 陣列每週期每單元一 MAC、1 GHz，且 MAC 計兩 FLOP：峰值=128²×2×10⁹=32.768 TFLOP/s。若有效利用率 60%，為 19.661 TFLOP/s；不是任一真實 TPU 的產品規格。",
                  "textEn": "A hypothetical 128×128 MAC array at one MAC/cell/cycle and 1 GHz gives 32.768 TFLOP/s counting two FLOPs/MAC; assumed 60% utilization gives 19.661 TFLOP/s. This is not a real TPU specification.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-tpu",
                    "v11a-bf16"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「張量維度」與整體「張量運算加速器」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing tensor dimensions within tensor-compute accelerators, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "矩陣相乘的內維度必須相容。",
                  "BF16 與 FP16 有相同指數和尾數配置。",
                  "峰值 FLOP/s 可直接當作端到端訓練吞吐。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Matrix inner dimensions must agree.",
                  "BF16 and FP16 have identical exponent and mantissa layouts.",
                  "Peak FLOP/s equals end-to-end training throughput."
