                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "矩陣相乘的內維度必須相容。 核對 M×K 與 K×N 形狀。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Matrix inner dimensions must agree. Check M×K and K×N shapes. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
