                  "id": "a305-v11-20-k1",
                  "title": "累加精度的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Accumulation precision principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "低精度輸入可配較高精度累加。",
                  "textEn": "Low-precision inputs may use wider accumulation.",
