                  "textEn": "Assume 200 MHz, initiation interval II=2 cycles and one 4 B result per initiation. Steady throughput=100 Mitems/s=400 MB/s; 20-cycle latency=100 ns. Short batches also pay fill and drain.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-hls",
                    "v11a-dataflow"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
