              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「功能契約」與整體「FPGA 資料流加速器」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing functional contract within fpga dataflow accelerators, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "C 結果正確不代表硬體時序合格。",
                  "II 與每筆資料延遲必定相等。",
                  "迴圈展開後記憶體埠數不再重要。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Correct C output does not establish hardware timing.",
                  "II always equals per-item latency.",
