              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for backpressure propagation. Downstream stalls can propagate upstream. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Pause a modeled sink and trace. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "暫停假想 sink 並追蹤。",
              "observationEn": "Pause a modeled sink and trace.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：II 與每筆資料延遲必定相等。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: II always equals per-item latency. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「回壓傳播」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「下游停止可向上游傳遞等待。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit backpressure propagation two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
