              "title": "C/RTL 共模擬：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "C/RTL cosimulation: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「加入邊界長度與回壓。」檢查「C/RTL 共模擬」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for c/rtl cosimulation using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「C/RTL 共模擬」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：加入邊界長度與回壓。 核對「共模擬驗證指定輸入而非所有情境。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for c/rtl cosimulation and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Add boundary lengths and backpressure. Check the principle: Cosimulation validates tested inputs, not all cases. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "加入邊界長度與回壓。",
              "observationEn": "Add boundary lengths and backpressure.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：II 與每筆資料延遲必定相等。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: II always equals per-item latency. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「C/RTL 共模擬」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「加入邊界長度與回壓。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit c/rtl cosimulation input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a306-v11-26-k1",
                  "title": "C/RTL 共模擬的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "C/RTL cosimulation principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "共模擬驗證指定輸入而非所有情境。",
                  "textEn": "Cosimulation validates tested inputs, not all cases.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-hls",
                    "v11a-dataflow"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a306-v11-26-k2",
                  "title": "C/RTL 共模擬的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "C/RTL cosimulation validation design",
                  "text": "加入邊界長度與回壓。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Add boundary lengths and backpressure. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-hls",
                    "v11a-dataflow"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「C/RTL 共模擬」與整體「FPGA 資料流加速器」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing c/rtl cosimulation within fpga dataflow accelerators, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "II 與每筆資料延遲必定相等。",
                  "加入邊界長度與回壓。",
                  "迴圈展開後記憶體埠數不再重要。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "II always equals per-item latency.",
                  "Add boundary lengths and backpressure.",
                  "Memory ports cease to matter after loop unrolling."
                ],
                "answer": 1,
                "explanation": "共模擬驗證指定輸入而非所有情境。 加入邊界長度與回壓。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Cosimulation validates tested inputs, not all cases. Add boundary lengths and backpressure. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
            },
