              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「資源報告」的資料、控制與時間關係。DSP、BRAM 與暫存器限制不同。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「建立三項獨立資源預算。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for resource reports. DSP, BRAM and registers impose different limits. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Build three separate resource budgets. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "建立三項獨立資源預算。",
              "observationEn": "Build three separate resource budgets.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：迴圈展開後記憶體埠數不再重要。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Memory ports cease to matter after loop unrolling. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「資源報告」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「DSP、BRAM 與暫存器限制不同。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit resource reports two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
