              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for end-to-end comparison.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「端到端比較」的資料、控制與時間關係。DMA 與主機整理可能主導耗時。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「把資料傳輸納入總帳。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for end-to-end comparison. DMA and host preparation can dominate runtime. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Include transfers in the total budget. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
