                  "id": "a307-v11-02-k3",
                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假設 128-bit flit、1 GHz、每週期一 flit，單向鏈路原始速率=16 GB/s。64 B 封包不計標頭需四 flit；四跳每跳 2 cycles 的空載路由延遲 8 ns，序列化另計。",
                  "textEn": "A 128-bit link at 1 GHz with one flit/cycle has 16 GB/s raw one-way rate. A 64 B packet needs four payload flits. Four hops at 2 cycles/hop give 8 ns unloaded routing latency; serialization is additional.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-noc",
                    "v11a-garnet"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
