                  "鏈路峰值可直接當作全部端點吞吐。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Inspect cycles in a dependency graph.",
                  "More virtual channels automatically prove deadlock freedom.",
                  "Peak link rate equals total endpoint throughput."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "循環相依是死鎖分析的重要結構。 畫通道相依圖檢查循環。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Cycles matter in channel-dependency analysis. Inspect cycles in a dependency graph. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
