              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for hotspot traffic.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「熱點流量」的資料、控制與時間關係。平均均勻流量不能代表熱點工作量。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「比較均勻與單點目的地。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for hotspot traffic. Uniform averages miss hotspot workloads. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Compare uniform and single-destination traffic. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "比較均勻與單點目的地。",
              "observationEn": "Compare uniform and single-destination traffic.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：鏈路峰值可直接當作全部端點吞吐。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Peak link rate equals total endpoint throughput. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「熱點流量」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「平均均勻流量不能代表熱點工作量。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit hotspot traffic two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a307-v11-27-k1",
                  "title": "熱點流量的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Hotspot traffic principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "平均均勻流量不能代表熱點工作量。",
                  "textEn": "Uniform averages miss hotspot workloads.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-noc",
                    "v11a-garnet"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a307-v11-27-k2",
                  "title": "熱點流量的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Hotspot traffic validation design",
                  "text": "比較均勻與單點目的地。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare uniform and single-destination traffic. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-noc",
                    "v11a-garnet"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「熱點流量」與整體「片上網路路由器」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing hotspot traffic within network-on-chip routers, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "增加虛擬通道即自動證明無死鎖。",
                  "鏈路峰值可直接當作全部端點吞吐。",
                  "平均均勻流量不能代表熱點工作量。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "More virtual channels automatically prove deadlock freedom.",
                  "Peak link rate equals total endpoint throughput.",
                  "Uniform averages miss hotspot workloads."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "平均均勻流量不能代表熱點工作量。 比較均勻與單點目的地。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Uniform averages miss hotspot workloads. Compare uniform and single-destination traffic. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
