              "instruction": "重播師傅對「ECC 距離」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：對小碼字列出翻位結果。 核對「碼距決定可偵測與可更正能力。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for ecc distance and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Enumerate flips in a small codeword. Check the principle: Code distance determines detection and correction. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "對小碼字列出翻位結果。",
              "observationEn": "Enumerate flips in a small codeword.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：ECC 可更正任何位元數的錯誤。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: ECC corrects arbitrarily many bit errors. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「ECC 距離」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「對小碼字列出翻位結果。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit ecc distance input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a308-v11-18-k1",
                  "title": "ECC 距離的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "ECC distance principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "碼距決定可偵測與可更正能力。",
                  "textEn": "Code distance determines detection and correction.",
                  "sourceIds": [
