              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「ECC 距離」與整體「記憶體控制器與 ECC」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing ecc distance within memory controllers and ecc, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
