              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for scrub frequency.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「巡檢頻率」的資料、控制與時間關係。巡檢間隔影響累積未修正錯誤窗口。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「比較兩種假想巡檢週期。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for scrub frequency. Scrub intervals affect accumulated-error windows. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Compare two assumed scrub periods. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "比較兩種假想巡檢週期。",
              "observationEn": "Compare two assumed scrub periods.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：6400 MT/s 代表每秒 6400 百萬完整記憶體命令。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: 6400 MT/s means 6400 million full memory commands per second. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「巡檢頻率」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「巡檢間隔影響累積未修正錯誤窗口。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit scrub frequency two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a308-v11-23-k1",
                  "title": "巡檢頻率的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Scrub frequency principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "巡檢間隔影響累積未修正錯誤窗口。",
