                  "text": "假設單通道 64-bit 資料匯流排、6400 MT/s：資料峰值=8 B×6.4×10⁹/s=51.2 GB/s，未含 refresh 與排程。假想 64-bit 資料加 8-bit ECC，儲存額外=8/64=12.5%；不是所有 DIMM 編碼。",
                  "textEn": "A hypothetical 64-bit channel at 6400 MT/s has 51.2 GB/s payload peak, excluding refresh and scheduling. A hypothetical 64+8 ECC word has 12.5% storage overhead; not all DIMMs use this code.",
