              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「搶佔成本」的資料、控制與時間關係。切換、快取與中斷增加額外時間。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「在時間線加入假想切換成本。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for preemption cost. Switching, cache and interrupts add overhead. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Add assumed switching costs to timing. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
