              "observationEn": "Add assumed switching costs to timing.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：優先權繼承能消除所有阻塞時間。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Priority inheritance removes every blocking interval. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
