              "title": "優先權繼承：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "Priority inheritance: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「比較有無繼承的等待界。」檢查「優先權繼承」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for priority inheritance using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「優先權繼承」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：比較有無繼承的等待界。 核對「繼承緩解特定反轉，不消除全部阻塞。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for priority inheritance and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Compare waiting bounds with inheritance. Check the principle: Inheritance mitigates inversion, not all blocking. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "比較有無繼承的等待界。",
              "observationEn": "Compare waiting bounds with inheritance.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：優先權繼承能消除所有阻塞時間。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Priority inheritance removes every blocking interval. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「優先權繼承」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「比較有無繼承的等待界。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit priority inheritance input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a309-v11-14-k1",
                  "title": "優先權繼承的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Priority inheritance principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "繼承緩解特定反轉，不消除全部阻塞。",
                  "textEn": "Inheritance mitigates inversion, not all blocking.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-schedule",
                    "v11a-mutex"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a309-v11-14-k2",
                  "title": "優先權繼承的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Priority inheritance validation design",
                  "text": "比較有無繼承的等待界。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare waiting bounds with inheritance. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-schedule",
                    "v11a-mutex"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「優先權繼承」與整體「嵌入式即時作業系統」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing priority inheritance within embedded real-time operating systems, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "優先權繼承能消除所有阻塞時間。",
                  "比較有無繼承的等待界。",
                  "平均延遲合格即證明硬即時合格。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Priority inheritance removes every blocking interval.",
                  "Compare waiting bounds with inheritance.",
                  "Passing mean latency proves hard real-time compliance."
                ],
                "answer": 1,
                "explanation": "繼承緩解特定反轉，不消除全部阻塞。 比較有無繼承的等待界。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Inheritance mitigates inversion, not all blocking. Compare waiting bounds with inheritance. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
