              "instructionEn": "Arrange read, verify, policy decision and execute into a state machine, with stop or trusted recovery on failure. Swap verification and execution deliberately and identify the broken trust assumption.",
              "observation": "記錄已執行程式的雜湊，不等於事先阻止未授權程式執行。",
              "observationEn": "Recording a hash of executed code is not the same as preventing unauthorized execution beforehand.",
              "failure": "只有成功路徑而無失敗分支的流程圖，不能描述安全啟動的完整決策。",
              "failureEn": "A success-only flowchart cannot describe the full secure-boot decision.",
              "check": "每個失敗狀態都不會直接跳到未驗證映像執行。",
              "checkEn": "No failure state directly transfers control to an unverified image.",
              "knowledge": [
