                  "title": "時間順序",
                  "titleEn": "Ordering matters",
                  "text": "驗證要保護執行交接，就必須在該交接前產生有效決定。",
                  "textEn": "Verification protects an execution handoff only when it establishes a valid decision before that handoff."
                },
