                  "title": "紀錄與阻擋",
                  "titleEn": "Recording versus blocking",
                  "text": "量測或稽核紀錄可補充證據，但不能假定等同阻擋機制。",
                  "textEn": "Measurement or audit records add evidence but must not be assumed equivalent to blocking."
                }
