                {
                  "id": "a310-v11-01-k3",
                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假設驗證 32 MiB 映像，雜湊持續速率 400 MiB/s，僅雜湊下界=80 ms；另假定兩次簽章驗證各 5 ms，總 90 ms，未含讀取與初始化。不是任何裝置實測。",
                  "textEn": "Assume a 32 MiB image hashed at sustained 400 MiB/s: hashing lower bound=80 ms. Two assumed 5 ms signature checks give 90 ms total, excluding reads and initialization; not a device measurement.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-firmware",
                    "v11a-verified"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
