              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「信任起點」與整體「安全啟動與韌體信任鏈」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing trust anchor within secure boot and firmware chains of trust, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "驗證公鑰本身需受可信邊界保護。",
                  "所有簽過章的舊映像皆可安全回退。",
                  "Measured boot 必定拒絕不可信映像。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Verification keys themselves need protection.",
                  "Every signed old image is safe to roll back.",
                  "Measured boot necessarily rejects untrusted images."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "驗證公鑰本身需受可信邊界保護。 標出可寫與唯讀儲存。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Verification keys themselves need protection. Mark writable and read-only storage. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
