              "instruction": "重播師傅對「測量與驗證」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。 核對「測量記錄摘要不等於阻止執行。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for measurement and verification and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Compare recording and rejection policies. Check the principle: Measurements record hashes but need not block execution. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。",
              "observationEn": "Compare recording and rejection policies.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：所有簽過章的舊映像皆可安全回退。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Every signed old image is safe to roll back. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「測量與驗證」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit measurement and verification input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a310-v11-06-k1",
                  "title": "測量與驗證的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Measurement and verification principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "測量記錄摘要不等於阻止執行。",
                  "textEn": "Measurements record hashes but need not block execution.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-firmware",
                    "v11a-verified"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a310-v11-06-k2",
                  "title": "測量與驗證的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Measurement and verification validation design",
                  "text": "比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare recording and rejection policies. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-firmware",
                    "v11a-verified"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「測量與驗證」與整體「安全啟動與韌體信任鏈」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing measurement and verification within secure boot and firmware chains of trust, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "所有簽過章的舊映像皆可安全回退。",
                  "Measured boot 必定拒絕不可信映像。",
                  "比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Every signed old image is safe to roll back.",
                  "Measured boot necessarily rejects untrusted images.",
                  "Compare recording and rejection policies."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "測量記錄摘要不等於阻止執行。 比較紀錄與拒絕兩種策略。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Measurements record hashes but need not block execution. Compare recording and rejection policies. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
