                {
                  "id": "a311-v11-02-k3",
                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假設 RV64 教學配置要求 2 MiB 對齊，實體位置 0x80200000 除以 0x200000 無餘數；0x80300000 餘 1 MiB，需調整。16 MiB 保留區佔 512 MiB RAM 的 3.125%；依選定啟動方式重查規格。",
                  "textEn": "Under an assumed RV64 configuration with 2 MiB alignment, 0x80200000 is aligned; 0x80300000 leaves 1 MiB remainder. A 16 MiB reservation occupies 3.125% of 512 MiB RAM; recheck the chosen boot specification.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-riscvboot",
                    "v11a-dt"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
