                  "title": "啟動 ABI的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Boot ABI validation design",
                  "text": "核對假想 bootloader 交接表。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Audit a modeled bootloader handoff. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-riscvboot",
                    "v11a-dt"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「啟動 ABI」與整體「Linux 核心移植」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
