                "explanation": "計時來源會影響排程與延遲量測。 核對假想頻率與換算。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Time sources affect scheduling and latency measures. Check assumed frequency conversions. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
