              "objective": "用「定位最後可見啟動階段。」檢查「主控臺」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for console using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「主控臺」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：定位最後可見啟動階段。 核對「早期輸出與完整驅動輸出路徑不同。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for console and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Locate the last visible boot phase. Check the principle: Early and full console paths differ. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "定位最後可見啟動階段。",
              "observationEn": "Locate the last visible boot phase.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：裝置樹本身會實作全部裝置驅動。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: The devicetree itself implements all device drivers. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「主控臺」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「定位最後可見啟動階段。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit console input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a311-v11-22-k1",
                  "title": "主控臺的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Console principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "早期輸出與完整驅動輸出路徑不同。",
                  "textEn": "Early and full console paths differ.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-riscvboot",
                    "v11a-dt"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a311-v11-22-k2",
                  "title": "主控臺的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Console validation design",
                  "text": "定位最後可見啟動階段。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Locate the last visible boot phase. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-riscvboot",
                    "v11a-dt"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「主控臺」與整體「Linux 核心移植」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing console within linux kernel porting, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "定位最後可見啟動階段。",
                  "裝置樹本身會實作全部裝置驅動。",
                  "一次成功啟動證明所有核心配置都正確。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Locate the last visible boot phase.",
                  "The devicetree itself implements all device drivers.",
                  "One successful boot proves every kernel configuration."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "早期輸出與完整驅動輸出路徑不同。 定位最後可見啟動階段。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Early and full console paths differ. Locate the last visible boot phase. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
