              "observationEn": "Compare single- and multicore traces.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：一次成功啟動證明所有核心配置都正確。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: One successful boot proves every kernel configuration. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「SMP 啟動」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「其他核心進入時機需遵守初始化順序。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit smp startup two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
