              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「根檔案系統」的資料、控制與時間關係。核心成功啟動不代表根目錄可掛載。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「核對裝置、格式與必要驅動。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for root filesystem. Kernel startup does not establish root mounting. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Check device, format and required drivers. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
