              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for synchronous ipc. Calls and receives pair and may wait. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Inspect timing without a receiver. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "檢查未有接收者的時序。",
              "observationEn": "Inspect timing without a receiver.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：核心證明自動涵蓋所有驅動與應用。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Kernel proofs automatically cover all drivers and applications. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「同步 IPC」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「呼叫與接收配對會形成等待。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit synchronous ipc two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a312-v11-13-k1",
                  "title": "同步 IPC的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Synchronous IPC principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "呼叫與接收配對會形成等待。",
                  "textEn": "Calls and receives pair and may wait.",
