              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「同步 IPC」與整體「微核心作業系統架構」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing synchronous ipc within microkernel operating-system architecture, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "呼叫與接收配對會形成等待。",
