              "instruction": "重播師傅對「共享頁面」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：核對 ring 的擁有權轉移。 核對「共享記憶體仍需要資料同步協定。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for shared pages and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Audit ring ownership transitions. Check the principle: Shared pages still require synchronization. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
