              "prerequisiteIds": [
                "a312-v11-27"
              ],
              "title": "證明範圍：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "Proof coverage: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「區分已證與未證組件。」檢查「證明範圍」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for proof coverage using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「證明範圍」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：區分已證與未證組件。 核對「已證核心不代表所有應用皆已證。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for proof coverage and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Separate verified and unverified components. Check the principle: A verified kernel does not verify every application. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "區分已證與未證組件。",
              "observationEn": "Separate verified and unverified components.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：使用者態驅動無需考慮 DMA 權限。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: User-mode drivers need no DMA permission analysis. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「證明範圍」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「區分已證與未證組件。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit proof coverage input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a312-v11-28-k1",
                  "title": "證明範圍的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Proof coverage principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "已證核心不代表所有應用皆已證。",
                  "textEn": "A verified kernel does not verify every application.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-ipc",
                    "v11a-proof"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a312-v11-28-k2",
                  "title": "證明範圍的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Proof coverage validation design",
                  "text": "區分已證與未證組件。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Separate verified and unverified components. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-ipc",
                    "v11a-proof"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「證明範圍」與整體「微核心作業系統架構」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing proof coverage within microkernel operating-system architecture, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "區分已證與未證組件。",
                  "核心證明自動涵蓋所有驅動與應用。",
                  "使用者態驅動無需考慮 DMA 權限。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Separate verified and unverified components.",
                  "Kernel proofs automatically cover all drivers and applications.",
                  "User-mode drivers need no DMA permission analysis."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "已證核心不代表所有應用皆已證。 區分已證與未證組件。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "A verified kernel does not verify every application. Separate verified and unverified components. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
