                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假想教學函式有三個基本區塊：entry、then、merge。分支在 then 定義 x1、entry 定義 x0，merge 需一個 phi（兩 incoming）。若迴圈再添加一個回邊，需依 CFG 重算而非沿用兩值。",
                  "textEn": "A toy function has entry, then and merge blocks. With x1 defined in then and x0 in entry, merge needs one phi with two incoming values. Adding a loop back edge requires CFG-dependent recalculation.",
