              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for function interfaces using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「函式介面」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：核對兩個假想呼叫點。 核對「參數、傳回型別與呼叫契約需相容。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for function interfaces and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Audit two fictional call sites. Check the principle: Parameters, returns and calling contracts agree. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "核對兩個假想呼叫點。",
              "observationEn": "Audit two fictional call sites.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：Phi 的輸入與 CFG predecessor 無關。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
