              "check": "提交「函式介面」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「核對兩個假想呼叫點。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit function interfaces input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
