              "instruction": "重播師傅對「支配關係」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：檢查分支內定義外部使用。 核對「定義需在適用路徑支配使用。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for dominance and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Check uses of branch-local definitions. Check the principle: Definitions dominate uses on relevant paths. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "檢查分支內定義外部使用。",
              "observationEn": "Check uses of branch-local definitions.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：IR verifier 通過就等於原程式語義正確。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Passing the IR verifier proves source-semantic correctness. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「支配關係」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「檢查分支內定義外部使用。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit dominance input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
