              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for regression tests. Positive and negative cases cover language contracts. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Build token, AST and result comparisons. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
