                  "textEn": "Assume 40 ms compilation and execution reduced from 1.0 to 0.6 ms/call. Break-even=40/0.4=100 calls, excluding warmup, profiling, memory and deoptimization; fewer calls may be slower.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-orc",
                    "v11a-ir"
                  ],
                  "authorship": "original-hypothetical-exercise"
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「JIT 與 AOT」與整體「即時編譯與程式最佳化」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing jit and aot within just-in-time compilation and optimization, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "測例相同就可忽略最佳化的副作用語義。",
                  "比較啟動與穩態成本。",
                  "每個函式高成本最佳化必定降低總耗時。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Matching tests permit ignoring side-effect semantics.",
                  "Compare startup and steady costs.",
                  "Expensive optimization always reduces total time."
                ],
                "answer": 1,
                "explanation": "編譯時間位置與可用資訊不同。 比較啟動與穩態成本。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Compilation timing and available information differ. Compare startup and steady costs. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
            },
