              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for benchmark stability. Warmup, GC and system load affect results. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Keep versions/inputs fixed and repeat. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "保持版本與輸入並重複。",
              "observationEn": "Keep versions/inputs fixed and repeat.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：每個函式高成本最佳化必定降低總耗時。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Expensive optimization always reduces total time. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「基準穩定」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「暖機、GC 與系統負載影響結果。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit benchmark stability two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
