                  "titleEn": "Benchmark stability validation design",
                  "text": "保持版本與輸入並重複。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Keep versions/inputs fixed and repeat. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
