                "explanation": "暖機、GC 與系統負載影響結果。 保持版本與輸入並重複。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Warmup, GC and system load affect results. Keep versions/inputs fixed and repeat. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
