              "instruction": "重播師傅對「心跳與失效」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：區分慢節點與不可達節點。 核對「心跳缺失可能是網路隔離。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for heartbeats and failures and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Separate slow and unreachable nodes. Check the principle: Missing heartbeats may indicate a partition. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "區分慢節點與不可達節點。",
              "observationEn": "Separate slow and unreachable nodes.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：三份複本同一機架可保證機架失效存活。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Three replicas in one rack guarantee rack-failure survival. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「心跳與失效」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「區分慢節點與不可達節點。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit heartbeats and failures input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a316-v11-18-k1",
                  "title": "心跳與失效的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Heartbeats and failures principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "心跳缺失可能是網路隔離。",
                  "textEn": "Missing heartbeats may indicate a partition.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-hdfs",
                    "v11a-hdfsec"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a316-v11-18-k2",
                  "title": "心跳與失效的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Heartbeats and failures validation design",
                  "text": "區分慢節點與不可達節點。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Separate slow and unreachable nodes. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-hdfs",
                    "v11a-hdfsec"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「心跳與失效」與整體「分散式檔案系統」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing heartbeats and failures within distributed file systems, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "三份複本同一機架可保證機架失效存活。",
                  "抹除編碼省容量即代表修復沒有成本。",
                  "區分慢節點與不可達節點。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Three replicas in one rack guarantee rack-failure survival.",
                  "Erasure coding savings eliminate repair costs.",
                  "Separate slow and unreachable nodes."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "心跳缺失可能是網路隔離。 區分慢節點與不可達節點。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Missing heartbeats may indicate a partition. Separate slow and unreachable nodes. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
