              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for block reports. Liveness does not establish a complete block inventory. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Check report versions and missing blocks. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
