                  "title": "編碼池的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Coded pools validation design",
                  "text": "比較資料與索引復原責任。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Compare data and index recovery roles. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
