              "title": "讀取快照：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "Read snapshots: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「追蹤兩交易讀到的值。」檢查「讀取快照」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for read snapshots using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「讀取快照」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：追蹤兩交易讀到的值。 核對「可見版本取決於交易隔離規則。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for read snapshots and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Trace values observed by two transactions. Check the principle: Visible versions follow isolation rules. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "追蹤兩交易讀到的值。",
              "observationEn": "Trace values observed by two transactions.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：MVCC 等於所有交易均為 serializable。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: MVCC makes every transaction serializable. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「讀取快照」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「追蹤兩交易讀到的值。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit read snapshots input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-06-k1",
                  "title": "讀取快照的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Read snapshots principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "可見版本取決於交易隔離規則。",
                  "textEn": "Visible versions follow isolation rules.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-wal",
                    "v11a-isolation"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-06-k2",
                  "title": "讀取快照的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Read snapshots validation design",
                  "text": "追蹤兩交易讀到的值。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Trace values observed by two transactions. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-wal",
                    "v11a-isolation"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「讀取快照」與整體「資料庫交易與日誌」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing read snapshots within database transactions and logging, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "MVCC 等於所有交易均為 serializable。",
                  "資料頁先耐久而日誌後寫仍符合 WAL。",
                  "追蹤兩交易讀到的值。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "MVCC makes every transaction serializable.",
                  "Durable pages before their logs satisfy WAL.",
                  "Trace values observed by two transactions."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "可見版本取決於交易隔離規則。 追蹤兩交易讀到的值。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Visible versions follow isolation rules. Trace values observed by two transactions. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
