              "title": "死鎖：實驗與驗證",
              "titleEn": "Deadlocks: experiment and validation",
              "objective": "用「繪製兩交易持鎖圖。」檢查「死鎖」的假設、結果及失效邊界。",
              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for deadlocks using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「死鎖」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：繪製兩交易持鎖圖。 核對「相反鎖順序可形成循環等待。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for deadlocks and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Draw a two-transaction lock graph. Check the principle: Opposite lock order creates circular wait. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "繪製兩交易持鎖圖。",
              "observationEn": "Draw a two-transaction lock graph.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：資料頁先耐久而日誌後寫仍符合 WAL。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Durable pages before their logs satisfy WAL. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「死鎖」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「繪製兩交易持鎖圖。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit deadlocks input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-16-k1",
                  "title": "死鎖的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Deadlocks principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "相反鎖順序可形成循環等待。",
                  "textEn": "Opposite lock order creates circular wait.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-wal",
                    "v11a-isolation"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-16-k2",
                  "title": "死鎖的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Deadlocks validation design",
                  "text": "繪製兩交易持鎖圖。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Draw a two-transaction lock graph. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-wal",
                    "v11a-isolation"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「死鎖」與整體「資料庫交易與日誌」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing deadlocks within database transactions and logging, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "繪製兩交易持鎖圖。",
                  "MVCC 等於所有交易均為 serializable。",
