                "explanation": "相反鎖順序可形成循環等待。 繪製兩交易持鎖圖。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Opposite lock order creates circular wait. Draw a two-transaction lock graph. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
