              "objectiveEn": "Validate assumptions, outcomes and failure boundaries for crash replay using the specified experiment.",
              "instruction": "重播師傅對「崩潰重播」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：枚舉不同崩潰位置。 核對「重播需處理已提交及未完成狀態。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for crash replay and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Enumerate crash points. Check the principle: Replay handles committed and unfinished state. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "枚舉不同崩潰位置。",
              "observationEn": "Enumerate crash points.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：MVCC 等於所有交易均為 serializable。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: MVCC makes every transaction serializable. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「崩潰重播」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「枚舉不同崩潰位置。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit crash replay input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-26-k1",
                  "title": "崩潰重播的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Crash replay principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "重播需處理已提交及未完成狀態。",
                  "textEn": "Replay handles committed and unfinished state.",
