                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「崩潰重播」與整體「資料庫交易與日誌」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing crash replay within database transactions and logging, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "MVCC 等於所有交易均為 serializable。",
                  "枚舉不同崩潰位置。",
