              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「不變量驗收」的資料、控制與時間關係。資料庫提交不代表業務不變量正確。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「核對餘額守恆與唯一約束。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for invariant acceptance. Commit success does not establish business invariants. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Check balance conservation and uniqueness. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "核對餘額守恆與唯一約束。",
              "observationEn": "Check balance conservation and uniqueness.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：資料頁先耐久而日誌後寫仍符合 WAL。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Durable pages before their logs satisfy WAL. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「不變量驗收」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「資料庫提交不代表業務不變量正確。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit invariant acceptance two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a318-v11-31-k1",
                  "title": "不變量驗收的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Invariant acceptance principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "資料庫提交不代表業務不變量正確。",
                  "textEn": "Commit success does not establish business invariants.",
                  "sourceIds": [
