                  "title": "不變量驗收的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Invariant acceptance validation design",
                  "text": "核對餘額守恆與唯一約束。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Check balance conservation and uniqueness. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
