                  "title": "本課原創量化算例",
                  "titleEn": "Original course worked example",
                  "text": "假設每批 fsync=4 ms 且一次序列寫入，單筆提交理想上界 250 commits/s；每批 20 交易的 group commit 為 5000 transactions/s，上界未含日誌流量、鎖與排隊延遲。",
                  "textEn": "With assumed 4 ms serial fsync, one transaction/batch has an ideal 250 commits/s bound. Twenty transactions/group yields 5000 transactions/s, excluding log bandwidth, locks and queueing.",
