              "objective": "檢查協定是否依內容而非到達次序。",
              "objectiveEn": "Check protocol decisions beyond arrival order.",
              "instruction": "複製一張舊回覆卡；將兩張訊息交換順序；重播同一批訊息；檢查任期、索引與已提交狀態是否保持一致。",
              "instructionEn": "Duplicate an old reply; swap two messages; replay the batch; check terms, indexes and committed state for consistency.",
              "observation": "最晚到達的訊息不一定最新。",
              "observationEn": "The last message to arrive need not be newest.",
              "failure": "若以到達時間覆寫狀態，補上任期及索引比較。",
              "failureEn": "Add term and index checks if arrival order overwrites state.",
              "check": "測試紀錄包含原順序與擾動順序的結果。",
              "checkEn": "Record outcomes for original and perturbed schedules.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a319-v7-12-k1",
                  "title": "原理與限制",
                  "titleEn": "Principle and limits",
                  "text": "網路重複及重排是協定需面對的情境。",
                  "textEn": "Duplicates and reordering are protocol concerns."
                },
                {
                  "id": "a319-v7-12-k2",
                  "title": "驗證與判讀",
                  "titleEn": "Verification and interpretation",
                  "text": "不變量應在每一步成立，而非只看最終畫面。",
                  "textEn": "Invariants should hold at each step, not only in the final display."
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "最後到的回覆一定代表最新狀態嗎？",
                "questionEn": "Does the latest arrival always represent the newest state?",
                "options": [
                  "是，傳輸時間等於邏輯時間。",
                  "是，只要資料包較大。",
                  "否，要檢查任期與索引。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Yes; transit order equals logical time.",
                  "Yes, if the packet is larger.",
                  "No; check term and index."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "否，要檢查任期與索引。 網路重複及重排是協定需面對的情境。",
                "explanationEn": "No; check term and index. Duplicates and reordering are protocol concerns."
              }
            }
