              "objectiveEn": "Avoid hiding user experience behind one mean.",
              "instruction": "設計讀寫比與資料大小兩項變因；為三種假設負載畫延遲分布；比較中位與尾端；同時記錄錯誤率及排隊長度。",
              "instructionEn": "Vary read/write ratio and value size; draw latency distributions for three hypothetical loads; compare median and tail; record errors and queue length.",
              "observation": "吞吐上升時尾端延遲可能先惡化。",
              "observationEn": "Tail latency can worsen before throughput stops increasing.",
              "failure": "只報成功請求延遲會漏掉失敗，補上錯誤率。",
              "failureEn": "Include error rates rather than latency only for successful requests.",
              "check": "比較固定硬體及語義，並標明工作負載。",
              "checkEn": "Keep hardware and semantics fixed and state the workload.",
              "knowledge": [
