                  "id": "a319-v7-20-k1",
                  "title": "原理與限制",
                  "titleEn": "Principle and limits",
                  "text": "效能結論與工作負載密切相關。",
                  "textEn": "Performance conclusions depend strongly on workload."
                },
                {
                  "id": "a319-v7-20-k2",
                  "title": "驗證與判讀",
                  "titleEn": "Verification and interpretation",
                  "text": "百分位需足夠樣本與明確量測區間。",
                  "textEn": "Percentiles need adequate samples and defined measurement intervals."
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "只比較平均延遲有何限制？",
                "questionEn": "What limits average-latency comparison?",
                "options": [
                  "可完整描述所有使用者。",
                  "可能掩蓋慢尾端與失敗請求。",
                  "能取代所有負載說明。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "It describes every user completely.",
                  "It can hide slow tails and failures.",
                  "It replaces workload description."
                ],
                "answer": 1,
                "explanation": "可能掩蓋慢尾端與失敗請求。 效能結論與工作負載密切相關。",
                "explanationEn": "It can hide slow tails and failures. Performance conclusions depend strongly on workload."
              }
