              "title": "區分快照、壓縮與備份",
              "titleEn": "Distinguish snapshots, compaction and backups",
              "objective": "辨認節省空間與災難復原的不同目的。",
              "objectiveEn": "Separate space reduction from disaster recovery.",
              "instruction": "畫日誌、當前狀態及外部備份三區；標示歷史壓縮移除什麼；標示快照保存什麼；模擬誤刪資料後比較只剩副本與保有備份。",
              "instructionEn": "Draw log, current state and external backup; mark what compaction removes; mark snapshot contents; compare accidental deletion with replicas only versus retained backup.",
              "observation": "一致複製也會把錯誤刪除傳到所有副本。",
