                  "id": "a319-v11-12-k1",
                  "title": "領導者提交的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Leader commit principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "提交需符合目前任期的規則。",
                  "textEn": "Commit follows current-term rules.",
                  "sourceIds": [
