                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a319-v11-12-k2",
                  "title": "領導者提交的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Leader commit validation design",
                  "text": "分開復制數與已提交索引。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Separate replica count and committed index. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
