                    "v11a-raft",
                    "v11a-etcd"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「領導者提交」與整體「分散式共識服務」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing leader commit within distributed consensus services, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "五節點 Raft 兩節點仍可單獨提交。",
                  "Raft 的 crash 模型自動防止 Byzantine 節點。",
                  "分開復制數與已提交索引。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Two nodes alone can commit in five-node Raft.",
                  "Raft crash tolerance automatically prevents Byzantine nodes.",
                  "Separate replica count and committed index."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "提交需符合目前任期的規則。 分開復制數與已提交索引。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Commit follows current-term rules. Separate replica count and committed index. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
