              "observationEn": "Compare skew and message delay.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：Raft 的 crash 模型自動防止 Byzantine 節點。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Raft crash tolerance automatically prevents Byzantine nodes. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「時鐘假設」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「安全與逾時所需假設應分列。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit clock assumptions two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
