              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for history checking and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Check invariants in fictional histories. Check the principle: One test cannot prove all consensus histories. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
