                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-09-k2",
                  "title": "事件時間的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Event time validation design",
                  "text": "將相同事件以兩順序送入模型。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Model two arrival orders of the same events. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-kafka",
                    "v11a-flink"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「事件時間」與整體「資料串流處理平台」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing event time within data-stream processing platforms, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "所有分區 offset 能建立全域事件時間。",
                  "Exactly-once 處理自動保證所有外部副作用一次。",
                  "事件發生時間不同於處理到達時間。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Offsets across partitions establish global event time.",
                  "Exactly-once processing guarantees every external effect once.",
                  "Event time differs from processing arrival time."
                ],
                "answer": 2,
                "explanation": "事件發生時間不同於處理到達時間。 將相同事件以兩順序送入模型。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Event time differs from processing arrival time. Model two arrival orders of the same events. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
