              "instruction": "重播師傅對「窗口」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：比較滾動與滑動窗口。 核對「窗口邊界決定聚合涵蓋的事件。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for windows and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Compare tumbling and sliding windows. Check the principle: Window boundaries determine aggregation membership. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "比較滾動與滑動窗口。",
              "observationEn": "Compare tumbling and sliding windows.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：所有分區 offset 能建立全域事件時間。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Offsets across partitions establish global event time. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「窗口」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「比較滾動與滑動窗口。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit windows input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-14-k1",
                  "title": "窗口的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Windows principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "窗口邊界決定聚合涵蓋的事件。",
                  "textEn": "Window boundaries determine aggregation membership.",
