              "title": "檢查點：原理與架構",
              "titleEn": "Checkpoints: principles and architecture",
              "objective": "以「檢查點」建立可檢查的架構、原理與驗證依據。",
              "objectiveEn": "Establish reviewable architecture, principles and evidence for checkpoints.",
              "instruction": "先觀看師傅示意，辨識「檢查點」的資料、控制與時間關係。一致檢查點需銜接來源位置與狀態。 在離線工作臺畫出元件／資料流，列出輸入、輸出、保存狀態與合法轉移；建立基準與擾動兩種假想情境，寫下可被反駁的預測。以「追蹤故障前後 offset。」設計下一步驗證。記錄版本、單位、未知參數與模型外的行為。",
              "instructionEn": "Watch the mentor and identify data, control and timing relationships for checkpoints. Consistent checkpoints join source positions and state. Draw components/data flows offline; specify inputs, outputs, retained state and legal transitions. Build baseline and perturbed hypothetical cases and make a falsifiable prediction. Plan validation using: Trace offsets across failure. Record versions, units, unknowns and out-of-model behavior.",
              "observation": "追蹤故障前後 offset。",
              "observationEn": "Trace offsets across failure.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：Exactly-once 處理自動保證所有外部副作用一次。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Exactly-once processing guarantees every external effect once. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「檢查點」的兩情境架構／狀態圖、參數表與可反駁預測；標出哪些資料支援「一致檢查點需銜接來源位置與狀態。」。",
              "checkEn": "Submit checkpoints two-case architecture/state diagrams, parameter table and falsifiable prediction; identify evidence supporting the principle.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-19-k1",
                  "title": "檢查點的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Checkpoints principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "一致檢查點需銜接來源位置與狀態。",
                  "textEn": "Consistent checkpoints join source positions and state.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-kafka",
                    "v11a-flink"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-19-k2",
                  "title": "檢查點的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Checkpoints validation design",
                  "text": "追蹤故障前後 offset。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Trace offsets across failure. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-kafka",
                    "v11a-flink"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「檢查點」與整體「資料串流處理平台」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing checkpoints within data-stream processing platforms, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "一致檢查點需銜接來源位置與狀態。",
                  "所有分區 offset 能建立全域事件時間。",
                  "Exactly-once 處理自動保證所有外部副作用一次。"
                ],
                "optionsEn": [
                  "Consistent checkpoints join source positions and state.",
                  "Offsets across partitions establish global event time.",
                  "Exactly-once processing guarantees every external effect once."
                ],
                "answer": 0,
                "explanation": "一致檢查點需銜接來源位置與狀態。 追蹤故障前後 offset。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Consistent checkpoints join source positions and state. Trace offsets across failure. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
              }
