              "instruction": "重播師傅對「重播去重」的示範，在自己的隔離模型或試算表執行：用虛構 event ID 檢查。 核對「相同事件重播需避免重複業務效果。」是否成立；保留輸入、預期、實際結果與差異。至少提出兩個競爭原因，選擇一項能區分它們的新增觀察。依事前定義的語義、容量或延遲條件判斷通過／保留，未執行的真實平臺項目不得標為實測。",
              "instructionEn": "Replay the mentor for replay deduplication and execute in your own isolated model or worksheet: Check fictional event IDs. Check the principle: Replay must avoid duplicate business effects. Preserve input, expected output, observed output and differences. Propose two competing causes and a discriminating observation. Apply predefined semantic, capacity or latency criteria and mark untested real-platform claims unresolved.",
              "observation": "用虛構 event ID 檢查。",
              "observationEn": "Check fictional event IDs.",
              "failure": "常見誤判：Exactly-once 處理自動保證所有外部副作用一次。 本步需分開功能正確、資源上界與證據範圍，不可把假想結果當作真實平臺保證。",
              "failureEn": "Common mistake: Exactly-once processing guarantees every external effect once. Separate correctness, resource bounds and evidence scope; hypothetical results are not real-platform guarantees.",
              "check": "提交「重播去重」的輸入與結果對照、競爭原因、接受／保留理由；逐項說明「用虛構 event ID 檢查。」的證據與尚未驗證範圍。",
              "checkEn": "Submit replay deduplication input/output comparisons, competing causes and pass/hold rationale; state evidence and untested scope for the experiment.",
              "knowledge": [
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-24-k1",
                  "title": "重播去重的原理與邊界",
                  "titleEn": "Replay deduplication principle and boundaries",
                  "text": "相同事件重播需避免重複業務效果。",
                  "textEn": "Replay must avoid duplicate business effects.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-kafka",
                    "v11a-flink"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a320-v11-24-k2",
                  "title": "重播去重的驗證設計",
                  "titleEn": "Replay deduplication validation design",
                  "text": "用虛構 event ID 檢查。 保留基準與擾動的完整輸入／輸出，以語義、容量或時間條件檢查，並明列假想模型未涵蓋的現實因素。",
                  "textEn": "Check fictional event IDs. Retain complete inputs/outputs for baseline and perturbation, check semantic/capacity/timing criteria and state real-world factors omitted from the hypothetical model.",
                  "sourceIds": [
                    "v11a-kafka",
                    "v11a-flink"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "quiz": {
                "question": "本步審查「重播去重」與整體「資料串流處理平台」時，哪項陳述或驗證有依據？",
                "questionEn": "When reviewing replay deduplication within data-stream processing platforms, which statement or check is supported?",
                "options": [
                  "所有分區 offset 能建立全域事件時間。",
                  "Exactly-once 處理自動保證所有外部副作用一次。",
