                "explanation": "相同事件重播需避免重複業務效果。 用虛構 event ID 檢查。 其餘選項混淆不同架構或證據的適用邊界。",
                "explanationEn": "Replay must avoid duplicate business effects. Check fictional event IDs. The alternatives confuse architectural or evidence boundaries."
